---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = 'Sales & Inventory System Case Study | Jun Alvior';
const description = 'Case study of a 3-tier sales and inventory system built with Django. Featuring real-time stock management, POS, and business analytics.';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
<main id="main-content" class="flex-grow flex flex-col">
      <!-- ORGANISMS: Project Case Study -->
      <article class="py-24 bg-grey-light dark:bg-[#1a1a1a] flex-grow">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
          <!-- Breadcrumb -->
          <div class="mb-8 text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
            <a
              href="../../portfolio/"
              class="hover:text-wood-accent transition-colors"
              >&lt;- Back to Portfolio</a
            >
          </div>

          <!-- Header -->
          <header class="mb-12" data-aos="fade-up">
            <div class="mb-8 rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl">
              <img
                src="../../assets/sales-and-inventory.png"
                alt="Sales & Inventory System"
                class="w-full h-auto object-cover max-h-[500px]"
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
                width="800"
                height="450"
              />
            </div>
            <h1
              class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-6"
            >
              Sales & Inventory Management System (FJC Pizza)
            </h1>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 text-sm">
              <span
                class="px-3 py-1 bg-wood-100 dark:bg-wood-900 text-wood-accent text-wood-accent rounded-full font-medium"
                >Django / Python</span
              >
              <span
                class="px-3 py-1 bg-wood-100 dark:bg-wood-900 text-wood-accent text-wood-accent rounded-full font-medium"
                >PostgreSQL</span
              >
              <span
                class="px-3 py-1 bg-wood-100 dark:bg-wood-900 text-wood-accent text-wood-accent rounded-full font-medium"
                >Tailwind / HTMX / Alpine.js</span
              >
            </div>
          </header>

          <!-- Content -->
          <div
            class="prose dark:prose-invert prose-lg prose-wood dark:prose-invert prose-wood max-w-none"
            data-aos="fade-up"
            data-aos-delay="100"
          >
            <p>
              The FJC Pizza Sales & Inventory Management System is a
              comprehensive 3-tier enterprise solution designed to streamline
              restaurant operations, from customer ordering (Kiosk) to cashier
              processing (POS) and administrative analytics.
            </p>

            <h3>System Architecture</h3>
            <p>
              Built using the
              <strong>MVT (Model-View-Template)</strong> architecture, the
              system ensures a clean separation of concerns:
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li>
                <strong>Presentation Layer:</strong> Dynamic UIs for Customers,
                Cashiers, and Admins using Tailwind CSS and HTMX.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Application Layer:</strong> Robust business logic
                powered by Django, managing orders, inventory, and accounts.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Data Layer:</strong> Secure and scalable data management
                using PostgreSQL with full audit trails.
              </li>
            </ul>

            <h3>Key Features</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>
                <strong>Point of Sale (POS):</strong> Efficient order processing
                for cashiers with real-time stock deduction.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Inventory Management:</strong> Advanced tracking with
                low-stock alerts, reorder thresholds, and automated stock
                management via Django Signals.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Business Analytics:</strong> Powerful data visualization
                for revenue trends, top-selling products, and demand forecasting
                using Pandas and NumPy.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Dual Interface Support:</strong> Separate interfaces for
                Customer Kiosk (mobile-friendly) and Cashier Terminal/Admin
                Dashboard (web).
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Security & Audit Trail:</strong> Every action is tracked
                via a system-wide audit trail. Supports record archival instead
                of permanent deletion for data integrity.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <!-- End of Prose Content Container -->

          <!-- Technical Specifications (High-Contrast Fix) -->
          <h3
            class="mt-20 text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-10"
            data-aos="fade-up"
          >
            Technical Specifications
          </h3>
          <div
            class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 mb-16"
            data-aos="fade-up"
            data-aos-delay="100"
          >
            <!-- Backend Stack Card -->
            <div
              class="bg-white dark:bg-[#1e1e21] rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 shadow-xl transition-all hover:shadow-2xl hover:-translate-y-1"
            >
              <h4
                class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-8 m-0 flex items-center"
              >
                <svg
                  class="mr-3 text-wood-accent text-2xl font-bold w-8 h-8 text-gray-400 peer-checked:text-wood-accent transition-colors"
                  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                  fill="currentColor"
                >
                  <path
                    d="M2 20h20v-4H2v4zm2-3h2v2H4v-2zM2 4v4h20V4H2zm4 3H4V5h2v2zm-4 7h20v-4H2v4zm2-3h2v2H4v-2z"
                  />
                </svg>
                Backend Stack
              </h4>
              <div class="space-y-4">
                <div
                  class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between p-4 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-black/40 rounded-xl gap-2 border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700/50"
                >
                  <span
                    class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider"
                    >Framework</span
                  >
                  <span
                    class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-mono text-sm font-bold"
                    >Django 5.2.8</span
                  >
                </div>
                <div
                  class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between p-4 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-black/40 rounded-xl gap-2 border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700/50"
                >
                  <span
                    class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider"
                    >Language</span
                  >
                  <span
                    class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-mono text-sm font-bold"
                    >Python 3.12+</span
                  >
                </div>
                <div
                  class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between p-4 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-black/40 rounded-xl gap-2 border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700/50"
                >
                  <span
                    class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider"
                    >Database</span
                  >
                  <span
                    class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-mono text-sm font-bold"
                    >PostgreSQL</span
                  >
                </div>
                <div
                  class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between p-4 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-black/40 rounded-xl gap-2 border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700/50"
                >
                  <span
                    class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider"
                    >Analytics</span
                  >
                  <span
                    class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-mono text-sm font-bold"
                    >Pandas / NumPy</span
                  >
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Frontend Stack Card -->
            <div
              class="bg-white dark:bg-[#1e1e21] rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 shadow-xl transition-all hover:shadow-2xl hover:-translate-y-1"
            >
              <h4
                class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-8 m-0 flex items-center"
              >
                <svg
                  class="mr-3 text-wood-accent text-2xl font-bold w-8 h-8 text-wood-accent text-2xl font-bold mr-3"
                  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                  fill="currentColor"
                >
                  <path
                    d="M20 4H4c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v12c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h16c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V6c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2zm0 14H4V8h16v10zm-2-1h-6v-2h6v2zM7.5 17l-1.41-1.41L8.67 13l-2.59-2.59L7.5 9l4 4-4 4z"
                  />
                </svg>
                Frontend Stack
              </h4>
              <div class="space-y-4">
                <div
                  class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between p-4 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-black/40 rounded-xl gap-2 border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700/50"
                >
                  <span
                    class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider"
                    >Styling</span
                  >
                  <span
                    class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-mono text-sm font-bold"
                    >Tailwind CSS</span
                  >
                </div>
                <div
                  class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between p-4 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-black/40 rounded-xl gap-2 border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700/50"
                >
                  <span
                    class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider"
                    >Dynamic UI</span
                  >
                  <span
                    class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-mono text-sm font-bold"
                    >HTMX / Alpine.js</span
                  >
                </div>
                <div
                  class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between p-4 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-black/40 rounded-xl gap-2 border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700/50"
                >
                  <span
                    class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider"
                    >Charts</span
                  >
                  <span
                    class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-mono text-sm font-bold"
                    >Chart.js</span
                  >
                </div>
                <div
                  class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between p-4 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-black/40 rounded-xl gap-2 border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700/50"
                >
                  <span
                    class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider"
                    >Responsive</span
                  >
                  <span
                    class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-mono text-sm font-bold"
                    >Mobile First</span
                  >
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Project Links (Ensuring High Contrast Buttons) -->
          <h3
            class="mt-20 text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-8"
            data-aos="fade-up"
          >
            Project Links
          </h3>
          <div
            class="flex flex-wrap gap-6 mt-6 pb-12"
            data-aos="fade-up"
            data-aos-delay="200"
          >
            <a
              href="https://github.com/property360-2/FJC-Pizza"
              target="_blank"
              class="px-8 py-4 bg-gray-900 dark:bg-white text-white dark:text-gray-900 hover:bg-gray-800 dark:hover:bg-gray-100 font-bold rounded-xl shadow-lg transition-all transform hover:-translate-y-1 flex items-center justify-center min-w-[200px]"
            >
              <svg
                class="mr-2 w-5 h-5 mr-2"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="currentColor"
              >
                <path
                  d="M9.4 16.6L4.8 12l4.6-4.6L8 6l-6 6 6 6 1.4-1.4zm5.2 0l4.6-4.6-4.6-4.6L16 6l6 6-6 6-1.4-1.4z"
                />
              </svg>
              View GitHub
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- ORGANISMS: Footer -->
    </main>
</Layout>
